        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Giuseppe Tornatore, Giuseppe Ferrara\n- Works: The Best Offer, One Hundred Days in Palermo\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter\n- Topics: Italian film\n\nFacts:\n- Giuseppe Tornatore was born on 27 May 1956 and is an Italian film director and screenwriter.\n- One Hundred Days in Palermo is a 1984 non-fiction film directed by Giuseppe Ferrara, and Giuseppe Tornatore was its screenplay writer.\n- The Best Offer is a 2013 Italian English-language romantic mystery film written and directed by Giuseppe Tornatore.\n- The Best Offer is titled La migliore offerta in Italian and was entitled Deception in the UK.",
